  'f4a5a31d-2e2e-4d1c-b7f1-3d59e3031c28', 'd9cffc22-e158-44b9-8df5-c208403cf512', '045: Kola Infused', false, false, false, 90, NULL, 2025, 'https://bicpipgbspasxbtqjzvg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/bottle-images/variants/f4a5a31d-2e2e-4d1c-b7f1-3d59e3031c28/shelf-mtxapgzx-t0it.webp', 290, 'estimated',
  false, NULL, 'Producer bottle shot, cut out by scripts/chattanooga_load.mjs; needs a look on a real shelf.',
  'Flamed Orange, Root Beer Float', 'Lime Meringue, Cherry Cola', 'Lingering Cherry Cola', 'Experimental Batch 045: Kola Infused (September 18 2025). Mash Bill: A Blend of 4 Bourbon Mash Bills. Grains: Yellow Corn, Pale Malted Rye, Floor Malted Barley, Pale Malted Wheat, Honey Malted Barley, Caramel Malted Barley, Munich Malted Rye, Caramel Malted Wheat, Pale Malted Barley. Proof: 90 (45% Alc/Vol). Infused with: Kola Nut, Citrus Peel, Dried Cherries, Sarsaparilla, Vanilla, Cinnamon, Marshmallow Root, Ginger, Mace, Cardamom. Distillation: Double Pot & Continuous Column. Cooperage: Toasted & Charred Oak Barrels. Batch Size: 7 barrels. Style: Bourbon Liqueur. Release Date: September 18 2025. Producer tasting note: "Flamed Orange, Root Beer Float, Lime Meringue, Cherry Cola" (nose/palate/finish above are an editorial split of that line).', now(), now());

