  'Key lime pie, lemon meringue, orange blossom tea', 'Lemongrass, jasmine', 'Lingering jasmine', 'Experimental Batch 044: Bourbon Barreled Limecello. Mash Bill: Signature "Barrel 91" Recipe: Yellow Corn, Malted Rye, Caramel Malted Barley, Honey Malted Barley. Proof: 83.2 (41.6% Alc/Vol). Infused with: Lime peel, Lemon Peel, Galangal Root. Distillation: Continuous Column. Finishing Cooperage: Single-Use Toasted & Charred Bourbon Barrels. Finishing Time: 3 mos. Batch Size: 5 barrels. Style: Liqueur. Producer tasting note: "Key lime pie, lemon meringue, orange blossom tea, lemongrass, and jasmine" (nose/palate/finish above are an editorial split of that line).', now(), now());

INSERT INTO bottle_variants (id, bottles_id, batch, is_default, is_catchall, verified, proof, age, release_year, frontimage_url, bottle_height, bottle_height_source, shelf_ready, image_reviewed_at, image_review_note, nose, palate, finish, notes, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (
  'fb3dbd63-e1c6-40b6-90ae-4559fa96034a', 'd9cffc22-e158-44b9-8df5-c208403cf512', 'Alpha: Intergalactic Comet Crusher', false, false, false, 84, NULL, NULL, 'https://bicpipgbspasxbtqjzvg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/bottle-images/variants/fb3dbd63-e1c6-40b6-90ae-4559fa96034a/shelf-mtxapi2j-y7yf.webp', 290, 'estimated',
  false, NULL, 'Producer bottle shot, cut out by scripts/chattanooga_load.mjs; needs a look on a real shelf.',
  'Like having your brains smashed out by a bag of lemons dipped in 42 karat gold', 'Like having your brains smashed out by a bag of lemons dipped in 42 karat gold', 'Golden (producer: "dipped in 42 karat gold")', 'Experimental Batch Alpha: Intergalactic Comet Crusher. Mash Bill: Classified. Proof: 84 (42% Alc/Vol). Infused with: At least 42 botanicals. Intensity: 6EQUJ5. Recipe Coords: 1698/1009. Batch Size: 12 Majestic Barrels. Style: Bourbon Liqueur. In the summer of 2015, a craft of unknown origin crash-landed on the roof of the Chattanooga Whiskey Experimental Distillery. Among the wreckage: a malfunctioning android, blueprints for an intergalactic highway (straight through Earth—don’t panic!), and a glowing green bottle labeled: “Intergalactic Comet Crusher” Observables (per SA797): v, vi Producer tasting note: "Like having your brains smashed out by a bag of lemons dipped in 42 karat gold" (nose/palate/finish above are an editorial split of that line).', now(), now());

INSERT INTO bottle_variants (id, bottles_id, batch, is_default, is_catchall, verified, proof, age, release_year, frontimage_url, bottle_height, bottle_height_source, shelf_ready, image_reviewed_at, image_review_note, nose, palate, finish, notes, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (
  'a906462b-b41b-4fcf-b335-acdefa8c60e6', 'd9cffc22-e158-44b9-8df5-c208403cf512', '043: Pre Prohibition Style', false, false, false, 110, NULL, NULL, 'https://bicpipgbspasxbtqjzvg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/bottle-images/variants/a906462b-b41b-4fcf-b335-acdefa8c60e6/shelf-mtxapil3-fywq.webp', 290, 'estimated',
  false, NULL, 'Producer bottle shot, cut out by scripts/chattanooga_load.mjs; needs a look on a real shelf.',
  'Toasted raisin bread, choc. chip cookie dough, caramel corn', 'Dark honey, fresh plum', 'Lingering fresh plum', 'Experimental Batch 043: Pre Prohibition Style. Mash Bill: "Hard Endo" Yellow Corn, Pils Malted Barley, Heritage Malted Barley, Malted Spelt, Malted Rye, Acidulated Malted Rye. Fermentation: Kettle Sour (16hr) + Yeast Blend (Bourbon, Malt Whiskey Yeasts). Proof: 110 (55% Alc/Vol). Filtration: None. Bottle occasionally captures barrel sediment. Batch Size: 8 barrels. Style: Straight Bourbon Whiskey. Chattanooga''s first distillery since Prohibition is celebrating a decade of experimentation! Cooperage: #1 char + toast profile “18th” (12.5%), #2 char + toast profile “18th” (12.5%), #3 char + toast profile “18th” (12.5%), #4 char + toast profile “18th” (12.5%), #2 char + toast profile “Light” (12.5%), #3 char + toast profile “Light” (37.5%), all 53 gallon Producer tasting note: "Toasted raisin bread, choc. chip cookie dough, caramel corn, dark honey, and fresh plum" (nose/palate/finish above are an editorial split of that line).', now(), now());

