  'c6b37073-e113-49a7-9c2a-e50b8dca2eea', 'd9cffc22-e158-44b9-8df5-c208403cf512', '042: Amaro Barrel Finished Rye', false, false, false, 110, NULL, 2025, 'https://bicpipgbspasxbtqjzvg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/bottle-images/variants/c6b37073-e113-49a7-9c2a-e50b8dca2eea/shelf-mtxapj3s-dr3x.webp', 290, 'estimated',
  false, NULL, 'Producer bottle shot, cut out by scripts/chattanooga_load.mjs; needs a look on a real shelf.',
  'Aged fruit cake, star anise', 'Pumpernickel rye bread, tobacco leaf', 'Lingering tobacco leaf', 'Experimental Batch 042: Amaro Barrel Finished Rye (January 2025). Mash Bill: Pale Malted Rye (2 types), Smoked Malted Rye, Yellow Corn, Caramel Malted Rye. Proof: 110 (55% Alc/Vol). Cooperage: Toasted & Charred Oak Barrels. Finishing Cooperage: German-style Amaro Liqueur Barrels. Finishing Time: 3 months. Batch Size: 4 barrels. Style: Straight Rye Malt Whiskey Finished in Amaro Barrels. Release Date: January 2025. Producer tasting note: "Aged fruit cake, star anise, pumpernickel rye bread, tobacco leaf" (nose/palate/finish above are an editorial split of that line).', now(), now());

