  'Maple syrup, dried apricot, cinnamon toast', 'Citrus zest, sweet potato pie', 'Lingering sweet potato pie', 'Experimental Batch 041: Persimmon Infused (November, 2024). Mash Bill: A blend of 5 high malt bourbon mash bills. Grains: Yellow Corn, Blue Corn, Pale Malted Barley, Pale Malted Rye, Smoked Malted Barley, Honey Malted Barley, Aromatic Malted Barley, Caramel Malted Barley. Proof: 90.4 (45.2% Alc/Vol). Infused With: Persimmons, dates, fenugreek seeds, gentian, vanilla, cinnamon, orange peel, cardamom, & cane sugar. Distillation: Double Pot. Cooperage: Toasted & Charred Oak Barrels. Batch Size: 5 barrels. Style: Bourbon Liqueur. Release Date: November, 2024. Producer tasting note: "Maple syrup, dried apricot, cinnamon toast, citrus zest, sweet potato pie" (nose/palate/finish above are an editorial split of that line).', now(), now());

