  false, NULL, 'Producer bottle shot, cut out by scripts/chattanooga_load.mjs; needs a look on a real shelf.',
  'Peaches & cream, shortbread', 'Juniper, a hint of cardamom', 'Lingering cardamom', 'Experimental Batch 038: Peach Infused Gin Liqueur (June 2024). Mash Bill: Our signature "Barrel 91" recipe: Yellow Corn, Malted Rye, Caramel Malted Barley, Honey Malted Barley. Botanicals: Juniper, Angelica, Orris, Gentian, Coriander, Bitter Orange, Lemon Peel, Cardamom, St. Johns Wort, Cassia. Infused with: Dried Peaches (11 days). Proof: 84 (42% Alc/Vol). Finishing Cooperage: Single-Use Tennessee High Malt, 53 gallon. Finishing Time: 6+ mos. Batch Size: 3 barrels. Style: Gin Liqueur. Release Date: June 2024. Producer tasting note: "Peaches & cream, shortbread, juniper, and a hint of cardamom" (nose/palate/finish above are an editorial split of that line).', now(), now());

