  'Peach tea, vanilla pudding', 'Waffle cone, dried mint & candied ginger', 'Lingering dried mint & candied ginger', 'Experimental Batch 025: Appalachian Grist. Grains: Carolina Malted Rye, Appalachian Malted Wheat, Southern Select Malted Barley, Heritage Malted Barley, Yellow Corn. Grain sources: TN, NC, VA. Age of Blend: 4 years. Proof: 102 (51% Alc/Vol). Cooperage: Toasted & Charred Oak, 53 gallon. Batch size: 7 barrels. Style: A blend of straight whiskeys. Producer tasting note: "Peach tea, vanilla pudding, waffle cone, dried mint & candied ginger" (nose/palate/finish above are an editorial split of that line).', now(), now());

