  'Sweet & sour notes of muddled mint, orange blossom', 'Citrus zest, syrupy fruit cocktail', 'Lingering syrupy fruit cocktail', 'Experimental Batch 024: Mint Infused. Age of Bourbon: 4 years. Proof: 85 (42.5% ALC/VOL). Infused with: Fresh mint, apricots, sour cherries, citrus peel, lemon juice, vanilla beans, cinnamon, cardamom, black pepper & cane sugar. Cooperage: Toasted & Charred Oak, 53 gallon. Batch Size: 4 barrels. Style: Bourbon Liqueur. Producer tasting note: "Sweet & sour notes of muddled mint, orange blossom, citrus zest, and syrupy fruit cocktail" (nose/palate/finish above are an editorial split of that line).', now(), now());

