  'Citrusy, floral', 'Tart', 'Bittersweet finish', 'Experimental Batch 020: Citrus Infused Amaro. Age of Malt Whiskey: White (less than 24 hours in cooperage). Proof: 75 (37.5% ALC/VOL). Infused with: Citrus peel, honeysuckle, chicory, hibiscus, coriander, rhubarb & a variety of other botanicals. Cooperage: Single-Use Malt Whiskey Barrels. Batch Size: 4 barrels. Style: Liqueur. Producer tasting note: "Citrusy, floral and tart, with a bittersweet finish" (nose/palate/finish above are an editorial split of that line).', now(), now());

